is that you reviewed a book of mine.

38
00:02:07,293 --> 00:02:10,170
I did? Did I like it?

39
00:02:11,047 --> 00:02:14,550
-You didn't.
-Well, I'm sorry.

40
00:02:15,343 --> 00:02:18,762
