Since you two were living
rather modestly,

68
00:04:16,005 --> 00:04:18,590
I don't think the numbers
should be too bad.

69
00:04:18,675 --> 00:04:21,009
They're probably talking
about something like

70
00:04:22,553 --> 00:04:24,012
