Oh. Wow.

88
00:05:29,245 --> 00:05:31,663
Apparently she likes the place.

89
00:05:31,748 --> 00:05:34,207
It's near the right schools.

90
00:05:36,127 --> 00:05:39,463
Schools. She's...

91
