You're gonna get over this.

93
00:05:50,683 --> 00:05:52,976
You will, Frances.

94
00:05:54,604 --> 00:05:58,065
-Someday you're gonna be happy again.
-Mm.

95
00:05:59,275 --> 00:06:00,901
Right.

96
